    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Application</strong> — an insurance application your agent completes and submits for a
      Consumer arising from a Call, logged in the Portal with the carrier, plan, face amount,
      premium and applicant details.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Billable Application</strong> — an Application that satisfies Section 5.5 and for
      which a fee becomes due under pay per application.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Buffer</strong> — the number of seconds set in your Agreement that a Call must last
      before it becomes a Billable Call.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Billable Call</strong> — under pay per call, a Call that lasts longer than your
